          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2003 年攻读硕士研究生入学考试试题"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.167,
            0.313,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "考试科目:生物化学"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.204,
            0.564,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一.判断题（请用“+”和“-”分别代表对错）（20%）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.223,
            0.781,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.223,
                0.47,
                0.238
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1. 蛋白质的一级结构包括二硫键的位置。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.242,
                0.468,
                0.256
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2. a-角蛋白具三级结构和四级结构特点。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.26,
                0.329,
                0.274
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3. 别构酶都是寡聚酶。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.278,
                0.78,
                0.293
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4. 在酶的催化反应中，His 残基的咪唑基既可起酸催化作用，也可起碱催化作用。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.297,
                0.673,
                0.312
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5. pH 通过影响酶活性中心氨基酸的解离状态来影响酶的反应速度。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.315,
                0.554,
                0.33
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6. 蛋白质在小于其等电点 pH 的溶液中向正极移动。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.334,
                0.47,
                0.348
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7. 甲状腺素是由酪氨酸直接碘化合成的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.352,
                0.61,
                0.367
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8. 肾上腺素是由肾上腺髓质分泌的，直接受控于大脑皮层。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.371,
                0.434,
                0.386
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9. 蛋白激酶 A 是 cAMP 的唯一靶酶。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.223,
            0.821,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.39,
                0.643,
                0.405
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10. 皮质酮与其膜受体结合后，通过 G-蛋白将信号传至效应器。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.408,
                0.515,
                0.423
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "11. 核糖中五碳糖的构型是呋喃型五元环结构。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.427,
                0.517,
                0.442
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "12. 单链 DNA 比双链 DNA 有更高的  "
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\varepsilon(p)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "  值。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.445,
                0.649,
                0.46
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "13. RNA 分子中的发卡结构是由 DNA 中的同向重复顺序转录的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 20,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.463,
                0.821,
                0.479
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "14. 细菌细胞中的限制性内切酶与它识别相同 DNA 顺序的甲基化酶系统组成防御系统。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 21,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.482,
                0.444,
                0.497
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15. 基因组是细胞内所有基因的组合。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.5,
                0.631,
                0.516
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "16. 在 DNA 生物合成中 DNA 链是从 3'-末端向 5'-末端延伸的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 23,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.519,
                0.717,
                0.535
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "17. 细胞内的DNA合成产生碱基错配的主要原因是碱基的互变异构现象。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 24,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.538,
                0.642,
                0.553
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "18. 转录过程中的模板链也称正链，其碱基顺序与 mRNA 相同。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 25,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.556,
                0.408,
                0.571
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "19. 内含子的一级结构是无序的。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 26,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.575,
                0.629,
                0.59
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "20. 细胞中的每一个有意义遗传密码子都有一个对应的 tRNA。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.593,
            0.312,
            0.608
          ],
          "content": [
